	(descr "ESP32-C3 SuperMini soldered flat by its castellated edge holes (no headers). 2x8, 2.54 mm pitch, 15.24 mm between hole rows, 18 x 22.52 mm. Top view, USB-C up: left GPIO5-21, right 5V/GND/3V3/GPIO4-0. Pads reach 1.6 mm past the module edge for the iron. Copper keepout under the chip antenna.")
